Lemmy UI on FenrirOS
====================

Installed inert: the service is not enabled and nothing is configured. This is
only the web front end; the server is the package lemmy.

    mkdir -p /etc/lemmy-ui; $EDITOR /etc/lemmy-ui/environment
    # one KEY=value per line, e.g.
    #   LEMMY_UI_HOST=127.0.0.1
    #   LEMMY_UI_PORT=1234
    #   LEMMY_UI_LEMMY_INTERNAL_HOST=127.0.0.1:8536
    #   LEMMY_UI_LEMMY_EXTERNAL_HOST=lemmy.example.org
    #   LEMMY_UI_HTTPS=true
    touch /var/log/lemmy-ui.log; chown lemmy-ui /var/log/lemmy-ui.log
    dinitctl enable lemmy-ui

Put nginx in front (example in /usr/share/doc/lemmy/nginx-lemmy.conf.example).
